{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:01 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>由永泰及萬科香港合作發展的沙田UNI Residence獲批滿意紙，今日首度開放現樓單位，發展商指出全盤暫累沽約187伙，餘下單位有機會提價。</p>\n<h2>暫累沽187伙 6成為本地客</h2>\n<p>永泰執行董事兼銷售及市務總監楊聰永表示，UNI Residence剛獲批滿意紙，今日首度開放現樓單位予傳媒參觀，該盤暫累沽187伙，佔全盤近8成，買家比例方面，6成為本地客，4成為內地客，用家及投資比例各半。部署持續以價單推售，而餘下25伙有提價空間。</p>\n<img alt=\"項目單位及會所設計均出自Conran and Partners，融合周邊環境及空間美學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52cfdff8e893da7b689c989e96008e5b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_10_PM_1_.jpeg\" title=\"項目單位及會所設計均出自Conran and Partners，融合周邊環境及空間美學。\"/>\n<p>另外，項目於上周末已開放現樓單位予準買家參觀，過去3日內累沽15伙，套現1億元。</p>\n<p>萬科香港市場營銷及客戶關係部副董事及主管劉淑貞指出，項目單位及會所設計均出自Conran and Partners，融合周邊環境及空間美學。</p>\n<p>相關文章：沙田UNI Residence現樓發售3天連沽13伙 套現逾9000萬</p>\n<p>發展商今日開放兩個現樓交樓標準1房單位，位於29樓C室，面積297方呎，可遠眺大圍站及市景；29樓E室，面積292方呎，享獅子山翠景。</p>\n<h2>29樓C室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71780f1fe164eafadfb20f0946406575/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_39_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51f9d346eb4e69ad54d9fdb30dda0de6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_40_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abffd9f7b5a79184ab203a483ae4cd2b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_39_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e00123ee8dc9ca873f6faa2b6f1c1192/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_40_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5549a2a3beae70e2dc58967065c495a9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_41_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/369de3394060ba3906a4b3d8dfee9c23/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_41_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da15b9565b02d2f39dbba92ff3d86270/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_28_39_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>29樓E室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/938bc050760476d95ec89930daec15be/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_26_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ffbbf8eefcddbfdc9e2c09f5f04cc03/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_27_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b5edfda93c07e37f3466a2a59cb8bef/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_27_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24fb2de8fb5e93a6f7c25679dacb312b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_27_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b36a0539d6cf95758b97097a9adcacf/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_28_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0da791917abd5a88963875f0fa438e0b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_25_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>會所UNI Club面積約6,600方呎，提供宴會區、室內外健身區等設施。</p>\n<h2>會所UNI Club：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f36d38fef8783c90bc38227735e0dbe/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_47_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9b0491e6f6509b10f5042a14ef31d1e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eba700eb50f41fe606bc1b6af7999be4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_30_47_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63a4f59428577a964c79ef43e2088f63/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_24_47_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9283f1031054b894022992250605b99f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_1_24_45_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<p>相關文章：沙田UNI Residence增置業優惠吸客 短期內開放現樓參觀</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:19:27.449901+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":562,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}